#: ../../../tutorials/auto_tuning.md:17
msgid ""
"The following example demonstrates auto-tuning matrix multiplication. Code "
"has been simplified for readability - see `examples/gemm/example_gemm.py` "
"for complete implementation."
msgstr ""
